      <title>Canada Army Run: Another Successful Edition Attracts Thousands To Downtown Ottawa</title>
      <link>https://armyrun.ca/2024/10/02/canada-army-run-another-successful-edition-attracts-thousands-to-downtown-ottawa/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=canada-army-run-another-successful-edition-attracts-thousands-to-downtown-ottawa</link>
      <description>The 17th edition of Canada Army Run, presented by BMO, took place September 22 in Ottawa, where more than 13,000 participants joined various races alongside members of the military. Runners, rollers, and walkers participated in events including the 5K, 10K, half marathon, Sergeant Major’s Challenge, and Commander’s Challenge. The races were kicked off by Lieutenant-General […]</description>
